msgstr ""

#: src/php/traits/Admin/Menu.php:137
msgid "This is not end-to-end encrypted — it's a regular post restricted to the people mentioned. Sending is fire-and-forget and never blocks the scheduled run. If messages stop arriving, confirm the access token hasn't been revoked and the recipient handle is spelled exactly right."
